contentText:
Tyga isn&#8217;t denying the AI allegations.

The West Coast rapper talked to VIBE recently about his &#8217;80s-inspired $tarface alter-ego and the self-titled album it spawned, which has been suspected of being produced with the help of artificial intelligence. The speculation is now over, as he&#8217;s admitted to utilizing AI music generator Suno for things like &#8220;&#8217;80s synths&#8221; and a &#8220;guitar solo.&#8221;

